00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.540
This is a certificate of poop.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.100
You never thought that would
come into the conversation.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.590
- I wasn't sure if I was
supposed to come in anyway

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.330
because I didn't know if
it was gonna be a problem

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.870
but they said they were glad I did.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.146
And this is how I know
the bowel obstructions

00:06:07.146 --> 00:06:09.880
are extra dangerous is because
they said, if I waited,

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.350
that's usually how people
die from bowel obstructions.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.460
I wasn't in any danger of dying
because I came in way early.

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.180
It's usually people that
have these kinds of pain

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.670
for bowel obstructions and they wait

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.180
like a day or two days just to go in.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:24.520
Like if you've got some weird
stomach pain, go see a doctor.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.610
Like it's probably nothing

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.970
but it could also be your
intestines exploding.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:29.803
- Okay.

00:06:29.803 --> 00:06:32.070
I don't want people to
think if their stomach hurts

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.330
for a few hours, their
intestines may explode.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.730
- So that's why I think it's so important

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:36.860
to have a primary care doctor,

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.670
because if you have an
established relationship

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.390
with a doctor outside
of an emergency setting,

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:45.180
and you can contact that doctor and say,

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.630
is this okay?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.303
Is it okay to not run to the
emergency room right away?

00:06:49.303 --> 00:06:50.505
- That's exactly what I would say.

00:06:50.505 --> 00:06:52.960
That basically it's a triage component

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:55.980
that people don't appreciate as much.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:56.950
'Cause they don't think about it.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.360
It's natural not to think about it.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:00.776
But we have like a
24-hour answering service

00:07:00.776 --> 00:07:02.680
